WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.885 --> 00:00:04.018
I was chosen for the
female protection team

00:00:04.018 --> 00:00:05.131
four years ago.

00:00:05.131 --> 00:00:07.889
I can't express how excited I was.

00:00:07.889 --> 00:00:11.599
It was my dream, and the dream comes true.

00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:15.099
(upbeat electronic music)

00:00:25.132 --> 00:00:28.158
I'm first corporal
Omneyat Dawood Sulaiman.

00:00:28.158 --> 00:00:31.184
I'm working in Dubai police
in security, emergency,

00:00:31.184 --> 00:00:33.419
and protect department.

00:00:33.419 --> 00:00:35.647
- [Female Narrator] The pioneering,
all-female elite squad's

00:00:35.647 --> 00:00:38.014
role is to protect visiting VIPs

00:00:38.014 --> 00:00:40.291
at the big events in the UAE.

00:00:40.291 --> 00:00:42.734
Their training includes
hand-to-hand combat,

00:00:42.734 --> 00:00:45.006
firearms, and the kind of driving skills

00:00:45.006 --> 00:00:48.598
that put Hollywood stuntmen to shame.

00:00:48.598 --> 00:00:51.660
These women have safeguarded over 500 VIPs

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:54.187
on more than 1,000 occasions.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.458
- [Omneyat] We're 30 female in the unit,

00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:58.282
and there's different teams.

00:00:58.282 --> 00:01:01.359
We have the bikers and the drivers.

00:01:01.359 --> 00:01:03.996
I'm one of the bikers.

00:01:03.996 --> 00:01:05.533
- [Female Narrator] These
highly-skilled women

00:01:05.533 --> 00:01:07.853
go through rigorous training and only

00:01:07.853 --> 00:01:10.047
the very best can hope to earn a place

00:01:10.047 --> 00:01:13.159
in the elite squad, but for Omneyat,

00:01:13.159 --> 00:01:16.659
law enforcement is more than just her job.

00:01:18.899 --> 00:01:21.306
- [Omneyat] I decided
to be a police officer

00:01:21.306 --> 00:01:23.325
when I was 16 years old.

00:01:23.325 --> 00:01:27.026
My mom and most of my
family members are in police

00:01:27.026 --> 00:01:28.953
and as well in the army.

00:01:28.953 --> 00:01:31.819
I am Ghuson Sulaiman Abdula Almahmood.

00:01:31.819 --> 00:01:33.402
My rank is a major.

00:01:34.351 --> 00:01:38.824
I was one of the first female
officer in Dubai police.

00:01:38.824 --> 00:01:43.694
When my daughter became part
of the VIP protection unit,

00:01:43.694 --> 00:01:44.944
I was so proud.

00:01:46.009 --> 00:01:49.937
My granddaughter, she
also like to be police.

00:01:49.937 --> 00:01:52.360
It will be three generation.

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:55.915
Me and my daughter and
my daughter daughter.

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:57.881
- [Female Narrator] It's
not hard to see the appeal.

00:01:57.881 --> 00:02:01.232
These women have an important
and exciting role here,

00:02:01.232 --> 00:02:04.119
and although it's a demanding
and disciplined life,

00:02:04.119 --> 00:02:07.218
working and living in
this 21st century city

00:02:07.218 --> 00:02:08.912
has its own rewards.

00:02:08.912 --> 00:02:13.286
- [Omneyat] I love Dubai and
everyone, whether they are VIP

00:02:13.286 --> 00:02:17.805
or a regular person, they
have to feel safe in Dubai,

00:02:17.805 --> 00:02:19.709
and we will keep helping them

00:02:19.709 --> 00:02:22.626
because we are the protection team.

